   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>One way is to use html table tags directly like below<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">htmlTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">textConnection</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Name,Lat,Long<br>  Samurai Noodle,47.597131,-122.327298<br>  Kukai Ramen,47.6154,-122.327157<br>  Tsukushinbo,47.59987,-122.326726&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Use html table tags. Ugly and prone to errors</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addTiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  addMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;table&gt;<br>                                            &lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;Name&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Longitude&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Lattitude&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;<br>                                            &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;<br>                                         &lt;/table&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br> This works fine. However another way is to use htmlTable package and that is where I&#39;m having trouble. htmlTable takes a dataframe and converts into an html table<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># Use htmlTables</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> addTiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  addMarkers</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> popup </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">htmlTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
