    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">seq_along(df) goes by columns, not rows (so with e.g. cars, you get 1:2 instead of 1:50). Maybe something like this instead?<div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">df<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span>leaflet</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">()</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span>addTiles</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">()</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>  addMarkers</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(~</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,0,102);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Long</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">~</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,0,102);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">Lat</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span>popup<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">=</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span>lapply</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">rownames(df)</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(0,0,136);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">function</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">row</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span>htmlTable</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">df</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">row</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:monospace;font-size:10.5625px;line-height:15.8438px;color:rgb(102,102,0);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\">])))</span><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Wed, Jun 1, 2016 at 11:22 AM MySchizo Buddy &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">myschi...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">ok this is a bad solution<br>lapply traverses the df differently than leaflet does. <br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># Use htmlTables</span><span st